{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50409","headline":"二一 · 王梵志","name":"二一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"亲还同席坐，[知]卑莫上头（此句原本脱一字，一本作「知卑莫上头」）。\n（「知」，据伯三五五八、伯三七一六、伯三六五六卷补。\n）忽然人{火在}责，（「{火在}」，斯三三九三卷作「怪」，伯三五五八卷作「乖」。\n）可不衆中羞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50409.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50409","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}